# 1. Ignore EVERYTHING in the project
*
# 2. Allow directories so Git can search inside them
!*/
# 3. Allow all Python files anywhere
!*.py
# 4. Allow your specific dataset file
!CTG_dataset.csv
# If it is inside a subfolder, specify the path like:
# !data/CTG_dataset.csv

# 5. Allow standard documentation / configuration files (optional)
!.gitignore
!requirements.txt
!README.md